          ],
          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 1,
          "question": {
            "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are the eccentricities of a hyperbola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math>&nbsp;and its conjugate, then",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "JUV2N",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "q5jPz",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "NvEqs",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "lgYII",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "<p>Given equation can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>The equation of conjugate hyperbola is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>",
